<title>USA: First Republic sets 20 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>First Republic sets 20 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Republic Bancorp Inc said its board approved a 20 percent stock dividend for shareholders of record as of March 4.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend will represent an increase in outstanding shares of about 569,600 bringing the total outstanding shares after the dividend to about 3.4 million shares.</p>
</text>
